{"id":"41f90119525e0988","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-measure4-weak-star-convergence.md","title":"ZFC Measure4 Weak Star Convergence","display":"df-zfc-measure4-weak-star-convergence — ZFC Measure4 Weak Star Convergence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure4-weak-star-convergence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure4-weak-star-convergence"],"display":"df-zfc-measure4-weak-star-convergence — ZFC Measure4 Weak Star Convergence","depends_on":["[[./58-df-zfc-measure3-regular-borel-measure.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure4-weak-star-convergence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure4-weak-star-convergence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure4-weak-star-convergence — ZFC Measure4 Weak Star Convergence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5ec66a9c4b71ae42\" href=\"?note=5ec66a9c4b71ae42\" title=\"./58-df-zfc-measure3-regular-borel-measure.md\">58-df-zfc-measure3-regular-borel-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-integral.md\">../batch02/58-df-integral.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,\\mathcal B,\\vec\\mu,\\mu\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,\\mathcal B,\\vec\\mu,\\mu\\in V\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\)</span> is the usual topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RegularBorelMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RegularBorelMeasure}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5ec66a9c4b71ae42\" href=\"?note=5ec66a9c4b71ae42\" title=\"./58-df-zfc-measure3-regular-borel-measure.md\">58-df-zfc-measure3-regular-borel-measure.md</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\int_X f\\,d\\mu\">\\(\\int_X f\\,d\\mu\\)</span> is the signed Lebesgue integral obtained from the nonnegative integral of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-integral.md\">../batch02/58-df-integral.md</a> by positive and negative parts.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedContinuous}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedContinuous}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4WeakStarConvergence}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4WeakStarConvergence}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}continuous}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BoundedContinuous}_S(f,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb R)\\land\n\\forall U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\;(f^{-1}[U]\\in\\tau)\\land\n\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(|f(x)|\\leq c)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}continuous}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BoundedContinuous}_S(f,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb R)\\land\n\\forall U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\;(f^{-1}[U]\\in\\tau)\\land\n\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(|f(x)|\\leq c)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}weak\\text{-}star\\text{-}convergence} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4WeakStarConvergence}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal B,\\vec\\mu,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\mu,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\mu))\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RegularBorelMeasure}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal B,\\mu)\\land\\mu(X)&lt;\\infty\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RegularBorelMeasure}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal B,\\vec\\mu(n))\\land\n\\vec\\mu(n)(X)&lt;\\infty\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{BoundedContinuous}_S(f,X,\\tau)\\to\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\Bigl(N\\leq n\\to\n\\left|\\int_X f\\,d\\vec\\mu(n)-\\int_X f\\,d\\mu\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}weak\\text{-}star\\text{-}convergence} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4WeakStarConvergence}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal B,\\vec\\mu,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\mu,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\mu))\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RegularBorelMeasure}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal B,\\mu)\\land\\mu(X)&lt;\\infty\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RegularBorelMeasure}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal B,\\vec\\mu(n))\\land\n\\vec\\mu(n)(X)&lt;\\infty\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{BoundedContinuous}_S(f,X,\\tau)\\to\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\Bigl(N\\leq n\\to\n\\left|\\int_X f\\,d\\vec\\mu(n)-\\int_X f\\,d\\mu\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Convergence is expanded by the real <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span>--<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> criterion instead of relying on an undeclared limit operator.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"./58-df-zfc-measure3-regular-borel-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"5ec66a9c4b71ae42","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./58-df-zfc-measure3-regular-borel-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-integral.md","status":"resolved","id":"4884f45058a56aac","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-zfc-measure3-regular-borel-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"5ec66a9c4b71ae42","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RegularBorelMeasure}_S$ and $\\mathrm{Function}$ are as in [[./58-df-zfc-measure3-regular-borel-measure.md]] and [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]].","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RegularBorelMeasure}_S$ and $\\m